        "subject": "LU-21235 tests: wait for MDT disconnect in sanity-quota 91",
        "message": "LU-21235 tests: wait for MDT disconnect in sanity-quota 91\n\ntest_91 stops MDT0000, edits its quota index files and restarts\nit. The outage can be shorter than the client's ping interval, so\nthe client import is still FULL from before the restart when\nwait_clients_import_state checks it. The client is then evicted.\nThe test ignores the failure of the dd after the restart, so it\npasses without ever sending the quota acquire that LU-17770 is\nabout.\n\nWait for the client import to leave FULL after the MDT stops, so\nthe later wait for FULL sees the new connection.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=91\nFixes: 1f9689d0f9 (\"LU-17770 quota: don't panic in qmt_map_lge_idx\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ibb4627f9fb50276f0937bca23aa0c6223cce623b\n"
      },
